    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a dream world guardian,\u00a0watch dream worlds blossom inside your globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Autonomous Dreamer</strong><br>The dreamer boy mines, farms, and lives independently within the Dream Globe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820130/extras/addd3c72848646dcfde642a1d980857f.poster.avif?t=1755318367\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820130/extras/addd3c72848646dcfde642a1d980857f.webm?t=1755318367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820130/extras/addd3c72848646dcfde642a1d980857f.mp4?t=1755318367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Assistance</strong><br>Tap to help gather rare materials \u2192 Craft better meals and buy upgrades to boost efficiency</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820130/extras/ac7e3e62c1a577e4c9c25113ec96a754.poster.avif?t=1755318367\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820130/extras/ac7e3e62c1a577e4c9c25113ec96a754.webm?t=1755318367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820130/extras/ac7e3e62c1a577e4c9c25113ec96a754.mp4?t=1755318367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Trove</strong><br>Discover 100+ gemstones, crops &amp; foods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span clas